summary is: {{ Here is the summary of the conversation in the SOAP format:

**Subjective:** The patient is a 35-year-old male who has been experiencing a range of symptoms including severe headaches, loss of appetite, weight loss, and tingling in his arms. He has also reported feeling hot, short of breath, and having palpitations. He has a history of hyperthyroidism and is taking thyroxine medication. He has noticed a loss of libido and has had no previous medical problems.

**Objective:** The patient has no specific physical examination findings mentioned in the conversation.

**Assessment:** The patient's symptoms are likely related to stress and anxiety, although it is also possible that there may be an underlying medical cause. The patient's history of hyperthyroidism and his symptoms of palpitations and shortness of breath suggest that he may have an underlying cardiac condition. The patient's weight loss and loss of libido may also be related to his stress and anxiety.

**Plan:** The patient was advised to book an appointment with the doctor in the clinic for further assessment and examination. He was also advised to take thyroxine medication as prescribed and to keep taking it regularly. The doctor also advised him to try relaxation techniques such as deep breathing and progressive muscle relaxation to help manage his stress and anxiety. He was also advised to keep a symptom diary to track his symptoms and to report any changes in his symptoms to the doctor. }}<|eot_id|>
